00:52:35.624 --> 00:52:36.722
Grandma

1013
00:52:37.630 --> 00:52:39.325
Did you like archery?

1014
00:52:40.229 --> 00:52:42.027
No, look at that, then...

1015
00:52:42.698 --> 00:52:44.168
So what's the problem?

1016
00:52:44.235 --> 00:52:45.834
Just keep going

1017
00:52:45.901 --> 00:52:47.799
(Coach Yang) When you meet, during the competition
Because you won a gold medal

1018
00:52:47.866 --> 00:52:49.866
Grandma really likes it

1019
00:52:52.174 --> 00:52:54.540
Because I was bullied
I didn't quit archery.

1020
00:52:56.011 --> 00:52:57.076
I hate this too

1021
00:52:57.713 --> 00:53:00.312
If you keep receiving it, you get used to it.

1022
00:53:01.406 --> 00:53:03.084
(Gyeonwoo) And what about me?
I don't need anyone else

1023
00:53:03.151 --> 00:53:04.683
All I need is a grandmother

1024
00:53:06.321 --> 00:53:07.453
[Calm music]
But

1025
00:53:09.992 --> 00:53:11.857
Every time my grandmother comes to watch the game

1026
00:53:12.895 --> 00:53:15.628
I see people hate me

1027
00:53:17.933 --> 00:53:19.465
All I need to know is

1028
00:53:20.202 --> 00:53:21.500
What Grandma Finds

1029
00:53:23.205 --> 00:53:24.436
I don't like that

1030
00:53:29.998 --> 00:53:32.578
Goodbye, never see you again

1031
00:53:43.959 --> 00:53:45.293
[Coach Yang sighs]

1032
00:53:45.360 --> 00:53:46.625
(Sheep Coach) Our little lamb friend

1033
00:53:47.196 --> 00:53:49.061
So nice and cute

1034
00:53:50.699 --> 00:53:52.131
Perfect for archery

1035
00:53:54.102 --> 00:53:55.267
(Oksun) Our Gyeonwoo

1036
00:53:56.405 --> 00:53:58.404
my poor puppy

1037
00:53:59.972 --> 00:54:01.807
I'm sorry even when I look into your eyes

1038
00:54:02.811 --> 00:54:06.211
I feel sorry even when I look at your nose and mouth.

1039
00:54:07.149 --> 00:54:09.114
I'm sorry even though I held your hand

1040
00:54:10.204 --> 00:54:12.885
I'm sorry for everything, I

1041
00:54:17.492 --> 00:54:18.791
(Seongah) Grandmother

1042
00:54:19.811 --> 00:54:22.555
You say you're sorry for saying I love you

1043
00:54:22.622 --> 00:54:24.622
[Calm music - continued]

1044
00:54:26.301 --> 00:54:28.033
people in the world

1045
00:54:29.238 --> 00:54:31.236
Don't say sorry to Gyeonwoo

1046
00:54:32.107 --> 00:54:34.039
(Oksun) Even after doing something I’m sorry about

1047
00:54:34.810 --> 00:54:36.241
Don't say sorry

1048
00:54:37.746 --> 00:54:39.111
But our Gyeonwoo

1049
00:54:39.948 --> 00:54:41.847
Because I couldn't hear you say sorry

1050
00:54:43.318 --> 00:54:44.817
I know I did something wrong

1051
00:54:46.154 --> 00:54:47.720
I know it's bad

1052
00:54:50.144 --> 00:54:53.158
That's why I do it for you

1053
00:54:55.631 --> 00:54:59.531
I'm sorry that people in the world didn't say

1054
00:55:00.911 --> 00:55:04.036
I... do everything for you.

1055
00:55:05.007 --> 00:55:08.040
You're not wrong

1056
00:55:09.043 --> 00:55:11.777
you're not bad

1057
00:55:17.052 --> 00:55:18.150
Not yet...

1058
00:55:20.355 --> 00:55:23.455
I couldn't tell you everything...

1059
00:55:32.331 --> 00:55:35.203
[Sentimental music]

1060
00:55:35.270 --> 00:55:36.401
Fairy

1061
00:55:37.773 --> 00:55:39.071
Our Gyeonhero

1062
00:55:41.043 --> 00:55:43.008
I'm really alone now

1063
00:55:45.480 --> 00:55:46.678
(Gyeonwoo) Grandmother

1064
00:55:49.413 --> 00:55:50.616
Grandma...

1065
00:55:53.157 --> 00:55:54.823
[Gyeonwoo’s crying sound]

1066
00:55:54.890 --> 00:55:56.622
[Sobbing] Grandmother...

1067
00:55:59.494 --> 00:56:01.393
What should I do, grandma?

1068
00:56:01.460 --> 00:56:03.095
[Gyeonwoo’s cry]

1069
00:56:03.932 --> 00:56:07.032
[Sungah’s heavy breathing]

1070
00:56:12.069 --> 00:56:13.172
(Seongah) Ah!

1071
00:56:15.210 --> 00:56:16.375
(Oksun) Just once

1072
00:56:17.946 --> 00:56:19.411
Just once

1073
00:56:21.149 --> 00:56:25.350
Can we please hold Gyeonwoo’s hand?

1074
00:56:36.365 --> 00:56:39.164
No time to wake up the child who fell

1075
00:56:39.635 --> 00:56:42.367
I left too suddenly

1076
00:56:44.588 --> 00:56:46.916
[Sentimental Music-Continued]

1077
00:56:57.119 --> 00:56:59.151
[Sungah’s heavy breathing]

1078
00:57:01.765 --> 00:57:02.888
(Oksoon) I’m sorry

1079
00:57:02.955 --> 00:57:04.226
[Oksun’s sobbing sound]

1080
00:57:04.293 --> 00:57:05.424
I...

1081
00:57:06.728 --> 00:57:08.827
For asking such a difficult request

1082
00:57:10.999 --> 00:57:12.501
(Seongah) Grandmother

1083
00:57:12.568 --> 00:57:15.334
Aren't you looking at me too lightly?

1084
00:57:17.039 --> 00:57:18.237
About me

1085
00:57:20.242 --> 00:57:22.474
There's no such thing as being nice to me just once

1086
00:57:24.246 --> 00:57:26.778
If you treat me well once, I'll keep being nice to you.

1087
00:57:29.017 --> 00:57:30.649
Even if I change my mind, it won’t change

1088
00:57:31.954 --> 00:57:34.620
Just as God does not abandon humans

1089
00:57:35.324 --> 00:57:37.556
Just like a mother doesn't abandon her child

1090
00:57:39.027 --> 00:57:40.225
continue, continue

1091
00:57:41.496 --> 00:57:42.895
It will be sweet

1092
00:57:47.202 --> 00:57:48.267
Gyeonwoo...

1093
00:57:52.774 --> 00:57:54.239
I'll let you live

1094
00:57:54.877 --> 00:57:56.275
[light laughter]

1095
00:58:27.910 --> 00:58:29.041
(Seongah) Gyeonwoo

1096
00:58:29.574 --> 00:58:32.047
[Sorrowful music]
It’s very dark there, isn’t it?

1097
00:58:34.383 --> 00:58:37.382
just in your life
I know that the only star has fallen

1098
00:58:40.455 --> 00:58:42.187
I know you're in the dark

1099
00:58:43.892 --> 00:58:47.659
[Sungah’s heavy breathing]

1100
00:58:57.472 --> 00:59:00.973
Imagining light in the darkness
How difficult is it?

1101
00:59:10.586 --> 00:59:11.950
From now on I

1102
00:59:12.888 --> 00:59:14.252
I'm coming to you

1103
00:59:38.321 --> 00:59:40.012
[Sparkling sound effect]

1104
00:59:45.888 --> 00:59:48.520
I'm sorry, I'm like this

1105
00:59:49.725 --> 00:59:51.322
Because I’m the country you hate

1106
00:59:51.389 --> 00:59:53.658
[Sorrowful music-continued]

1107
00:59:55.686 --> 00:59:56.684
(Gyeonwoo) Hey there

1108
01:00:00.068 --> 01:00:01.466
No, what are you doing now?

1109
01:00:02.771 --> 01:00:04.394
Where are you coming from?

1110
01:00:04.461 --> 01:00:05.650
(Seongah) Why?

1111
01:00:05.717 --> 01:00:06.972
Am I somewhere I can't come?

1112
01:00:08.510 --> 01:00:09.941
Are you saying that now?

1113
01:00:12.915 --> 01:00:13.879
I'm going out

1114
01:00:15.083 --> 01:00:16.481
Get out, quickly.

1115
01:00:17.986 --> 01:00:20.518
(Gyeonwoo) No, can’t you hear me? Get out!

1116
01:00:20.585 --> 01:00:22.391
Oh, fuck off!

1117
01:00:24.426 --> 01:00:26.158
(Seongah) Still, I will save you

1118
01:00:26.628 --> 01:00:28.163
This thing without hair

1119
01:00:28.664 --> 01:00:30.429
in a way you hate

1120
01:00:32.634 --> 01:00:33.899
Did I come to see you?

1121
01:00:34.369 --> 01:00:35.801
Are you here to see your grandmother?

1122
01:00:36.705 --> 01:00:39.498
I never leave you alone

1123
01:00:41.021 --> 01:00:43.021
[Music: ‘Gyeonwoo and Fairy’ OST]

1124
01:01:21.416 --> 01:01:23.221
{\an8}(H) I heard your grandmother passed away?

1125
01:01:23.288 --> 01:01:25.008
{\an8}Have you finally escaped from me?

1126
01:01:25.075 --> 01:01:26.680
{\an8}(Eldest Dad) Until the last way you go

1127
01:01:26.747 --> 01:01:27.919
{\an8}Dirty like this?

1128
01:01:28.457 --> 01:01:29.421
{\an8}(Gyeonwoo) I’m sorry

1129
01:01:29.892 --> 01:01:31.960
{\an8}Because I am my grandmother’s misfortune

1130
01:01:32.027 --> 01:01:34.659
{\an8}(Seongah) Even if I can’t make you understand
I can protect it

1131
01:01:34.726 --> 01:01:37.299
{\an8}If I have no choice but to be hated, I want to be hated.

1132
01:01:37.366 --> 01:01:39.364
{\an8}I'll do what I can now, just

1133
01:01:39.431 --> 01:01:42.143
{\an8}(General Dongcheon) Until now
It seems like only three people died.

1134
01:01:42.210 --> 01:01:44.272
{\an8}Even ghosts die, there

1135
01:01:44.339 --> 01:01:46.308
{\an8}(Maeng Shaman) This is no longer a person

1136
01:01:46.375 --> 01:01:48.310
{\an8}It's a ghost wearing a human shell.

1137
01:01:48.377 --> 01:01:49.541
{\an8}(Yeomhwa) Hello?

